{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-7","level":"B1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Rund ums Wohnen 4","bn":"বাসস্থান ৪"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„gemütlich“ মানে কী?","options":["প্রচলিত","আরামদায়ক","সংকীর্ণ"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-7-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„möbliert“ মানে কী?","options":["খালি","পুরনো","আসবাবপত্র সহ"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-7-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„bezahlbar“ মানে কী?","options":["সাশ্রয়ী","উপকারী","জীবন্ত"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-7-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Der Gang ist sehr ___. Zwei Personen haben keinen Platz. (সংকীর্ণ)","options":["nützlich","eng","gemütlich"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-7-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„zuständig“ মানে কী?","options":["পারস্পরিক","বাধ্য","দায়িত্বপ্রাপ্ত"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-7-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„nützlich“ মানে কী?","options":["উপকারী","বিদ্যমান","যৌথ"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-7-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„gegenseitig“ মানে কী?","options":["প্রচলিত","পারস্পরিক","পরিবেশগত"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-7-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Miete ist ___, nur 300 Euro. (কম)","options":["eng","lebendig","gering"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-7-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Nachdem ich ___ habe, gehe ich ins Bett. (essen)","options":["gegessen","esse","gegesst"],"answer":0,"explanation":"nachdem + Perfekt: habe … gegessen।","id":"b1-practice-7-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Nachdem er ___ ist, ruft er an. (ankommen)","options":["gekommen an","angekommen","ankommt"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-7-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"___ ich die Wohnung kündige, suche ich eine neue. (আগে)","options":["Nachdem","Während","Bevor"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-7-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„während“ মানে কী?","options":["যখন, একই সময়ে","আগে","পরে"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-7-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich fühle mich hier wohl, obwohl die Wohnung klein ___.","options":["war ist","ist","sind"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-7-q13"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Wohnung ist ___ als meine alte Wohnung. (groß)","options":["großer","am größten","größer"],"answer":2,"explanation":"A2: groß → größer।","id":"b1-practice-7-q14"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ mich für die neue Wohnung. (interessieren)","options":["interessiere","interessiert","interessieren"],"answer":0,"explanation":"A2: sich interessieren für।","id":"b1-practice-7-q15"}],"requires":{"grammar":4,"vocabulary":4}},"schema":1,"id":"b1-practice-7","level":"B1","test":[]}